			"date": "2023-11-06T19:20:11.347Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://alpha.polymaths.social/@roguefoam\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>roguefoam</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cat/@zkat\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>zkat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ollicle\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ollicle</span></a></span> I believe it’d be pretty straightforward to change this today in any Eleventy project. Unlikely we’ll change the Eleventy-wide default though, that’d be too much of a breaking change</p><p><a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/data-frontmatter-customize/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">11ty.dev/docs/data-frontmatter</span><span class=\"invisible\">-customize/</span></a></p>",
