			"date": "2023-11-06T23:58:26.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cat/@zkat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zkat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ollicle\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>ollicle</span></a></span> ...and i'm back!</p><p>here is JALD, a web dashboard/launcher i've been tinkering with off-and-on this year: <a href=\"https://github.com/vfalconi/jald\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">github.com/vfalconi/jald</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>i use KDL to define the content in each dashboard.</p><p>and while we're at it, it doesn't include 11ty, but i also made a KDL-driven scraper for weather data: <a href=\"https://github.com/vfalconi/weather-mon\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/vfalconi/weather-mo</span><span class=\"invisible\">n</span></a></p><p>straight up, slowly but surely, i'm putting KDL into every fun project of mine that has a config more complex than key-pair. love it.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
